WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Hi, my name is JoAnne Gomez. I'm a
Registered Nurse with more than

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.580
27 years of critical care
experience in Toronto.

3
00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:11.860
I spent almost seven years in the
Medical-Surgical ICU at Toronto

4
00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:17.040
Western Hospital and twelve years at the
Trauma-Neuro ICU in St. Mike's

5
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:21.640
Hospital. I've also taken ICU shifts at
Sunnybrook and North York

6
00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:25.960
General, and I've worked as a travel
ICU nurse in New Brunswick,

7
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:28.200
Nova Scotia and Grand Cayman Island.

8
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.240
I've cared for patients with
major trauma,

9
00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:33.400
brain injuries and complex surgeries.

10
00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:38.500
Since 2012, I've been a post-operative
recovery nurse at the Toronto

11
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:43.080
Cosmetic Surgery Institute. I hold a
Critical Care Certificate

12
00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:47.300
from Humber College and a degree in
Psychology from the University

13
00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:52.060
of Nebraska, which helps me connect
with patients and families

14
00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:56.700
when they need reassurance. I
learn new systems fast,

15
00:00:56.820 --> 00:01:00.180
I work well with any team, and I'm
ready to bring this experience

16
00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:03.400
to your work environment. Thank
you for watching.

17
00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:05.140
I'd love to talk with you.
